msgid "Archived:Rover PX4FMU/PX4IO Wiring and Quick Start"
msgstr "已归档：Rover PX4FMU/PX4IO 接线与快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:9
#: ec674f04c6194952a015876eedc58602
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:11
#: 8da8fa695c72454d98a350d3717f683d
msgid ""
"The PX4 is end of life and is not generally available for purchase. This "
"article is made available for existing users."
msgstr "PX4 已停产，通常无法购买。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:14
#: d45d23f19662483599c68d2b85c1df13
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to wire up the "
":ref:`PX4FMU/PX4IO autopilot board <common-px4fmu-overview>` for Rover and "
"connect its most important peripherals."
msgstr ""
"本文提供 Rover 使用 :ref:`PX4FMU/PX4IO 飞控板 <common-px4fmu-overview>` "
"的高层接线信息及最重要外设的连接方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:19
#: d0ce22b29ceb4453a8985c8aa5890a45
msgid "Mounting the PX4FMU / PX4IO board stack"
msgstr "安装 PX4FMU/PX4IO 板堆叠"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:21
#: fea25c91723f4149a4bad130ca458d4b
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you mount the PX4FMU / PX4IO board stack upside down "
"with the PX4IO board on top to provide unrestricted access to the connectors"
" on the PX4IO board. If you do mount the PX4IO board on top you will need to"
" specify the :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` as number 8 or roll "
"180 in the Mission Planner Advanced Parameter list."
msgstr ""
"建议将 PX4FMU/PX4IO 板堆叠倒置安装，PX4IO 板在上，以便无阻碍地访问 PX4IO 板上的连接器。若将 PX4IO 板安装在上方，需要在"
" Mission Planner 高级参数列表中将 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` 设为数字 8 "
"或横滚 180。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:27
#: d1bcdac205c741fd866816279c577599
msgid ""
"See also :ref:`Mounting the Flight Controller <common-mounting-the-flight-"
"controller>`."
msgstr "另请参见 :ref:`飞控安装 <common-mounting-the-flight-controller>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:30
#: 54662cb9da1c48fba2d294f4f631913d
msgid "RC Setup"
