#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:65
#: d3679523f316405a8344202c25e0a821
msgid "Check out the Basic Operating Modes of the Rover2 Firmware"
msgstr "查看 Rover2 固件的基本操作模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:67
#: b2e2b70de38a4671a93db3e172c8ee5d
msgid ""
"**The board must have its automatic Safety disengaged before the Rover can "
"be driven.**"
msgstr "**驾驶 Rover 前必须解除板卡的自动安全锁。**"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:69
#: 01127214c2de4c429dfc06b8d8f15f03
msgid "**Safety Button LED Indications:**"
msgstr "**安全按钮 LED 指示说明：**"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:71
#: c5e2aaa0115c48f3a55c0e73cae8727f
msgid ""
"Fast Blinking indicates: Error Condition, Safety cannot be disengaged. "
"Possibly not calibrated or sensor error."
msgstr "快速闪烁表示：错误状态，无法解除安全锁。可能未完成校准或传感器故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:73
#: 362d496282a04a9da65d390100b8d778
msgid ""
"Slow Blinking indicates: Safe condition. Safety can be disengaged by "
"depressing Safety Button for 5 seconds."
msgstr "慢速闪烁表示：安全状态。可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒来脱开安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:75
#: 501193b055814f6c8518b78cb658a86e
msgid ""
"LED Continuously on indicates: Safety has been disengaged. PX4 controller "
"may be armed with Throttle down and to the right."
msgstr "LED 常亮表示：安全锁已解除。PX4 控制器可通过油门杆向下偏右解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:77
#: 266b174cc0a74ec584ecbe665a23d1aa
msgid ""
"When the LED is continuously on indicating Safety Disengaged it may be "
"toggled back to a Safety engaged condition by depressing the Safety button "
"for 5 seconds."
msgstr "当 LED 持续亮起表示安全开关已脱开时，可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒切换回安全接合状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:81
#: 2828dd6dbad544588a8793ecef03ccd5
msgid ""
"**Both the Safety engaged and Safety disengaged conditions require the "
"button to be held down for 5 seconds to toggle them.** This is a safety "
"mechanism to prevent accidental disarming during use and to prevent "
"accidental arming during transportation."
msgstr "**无论是安全锁启用还是解除状态，均需长按按钮 5 秒才能切换。** 这是一项安全机制，防止使用中误解锁，以及运输时误上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:87
#: 2eb2de2196494a4991fbeb8954fdbd76
msgid "Test MANUAL mode"
msgstr "测试 Manual 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:89
#: 11eb0480d6234484a080b74b0238c99d
msgid ""
"To test the Manual mode, put the Rover up on blocks, to prevent a runaway, "
"turn on the R/C transmitter, power up the autopilot (depressing the safety "
"button on the PX4FMU for 5 seconds to disengage the safety lock (LED solid "
"on)), and when a 3D lock has been obtained"
msgstr ""
"测试 Manual 模式时，请将 Rover 架高（防止失控），打开遥控发射机，为飞控上电（按住 PX4FMU 上的安全按钮 5 秒解除安全锁，LED "
"常亮），待获得 3D GPS 定位后进行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:94
#: fe644ee6bdb044abbe16910201416ee2
msgid ""
"verify that when the elevator joystick is moved forward that the rover goes "
"forward and vice versa, and that when the aileron joystick is moved to the "
"left,"
msgstr "验证升降舵摇杆向前推时 Rover 向前行驶，反之亦然；副翼摇杆向左时，"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:97
#: 6670355d438148e591c13bc47d15d8c7
msgid "the steering wheels go to the left and vice versa."
msgstr "转向轮向左转，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:98
#: fdcbf120f1e949d2b5be92ee4c05b62b
msgid ""
"A R/C receiver radio tester that can display channel PWM values can also be "
"used to determine the throttle and steering outputs of the Pixhawk."
msgstr "可使用能显示通道 PWM 值的 RC 接收机测试仪来确认 Pixhawk 的油门和转向输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:101
#: ea878c135f4b40579b7a813418bcb7a1
msgid ""
"If either the throttle or steering channel is reversed, then the R/C "
"transmitter channel reversing function must be used to reverse the "
"appropriate channel."
msgstr "若油门或转向通道出现反转，必须使用遥控发射机的通道反转功能对相应通道进行反转。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:106
#: 480c584a02dd4ec8b3db966abd41f7fb
msgid "Test AUTO mode"
msgstr "测试 Auto 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:111
#: 581461b012dc4f18a472de388804237d
msgid ""
"To test the Auto mode at least one waypoint that is either to the right or "
"the left of the home waypoint must be loaded into the APM using the MP "
"Flight Planner:"
msgstr "测试 Auto 模式时，需先通过 MP 飞行规划器向 APM 加载至少一个位于起点左方或右方的航点："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:115
#: 7c09c18060df4041ad66fc55b654f0c4
msgid ""
"Using the same test setup as in the Manual mode, verify using the Manual "
"mode that the Rover throttle and steering are still functional."
msgstr "使用与 Manual 模式相同的测试设置，先在 Manual 模式下验证 Rover 的油门和转向功能正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:118
#: bb5c6729b3a946019855e643c68771fe
msgid ""
"Then moving the mode switch to the put the Rover in the Auto mode, verify "
"that the Rover motor comes up to a speed commensurate with the Cruise "
"Throttle value that was previously selected and that the steering moves to "
"either the right or the left depending on where the first waypoint was "
"selected relative to the home waypoint. If either the throttle or the "
"steering is reversed, the Radio Calibration in the MP Configuration Tab (not"
" the R/C transmitter) must be used to reverse the appropriate channel by "
"checking the appropriate \"reverse\" box on either the aileron (steering) or"
" the throttle."
msgstr ""
"然后将模式开关切至 Auto 模式，验证 Rover "
"电机转速是否与之前设定的巡航油门值匹配，并根据第一个航点相对于起点的位置确认转向方向（左转或右转）是否正确。若油门或转向出现反转，需在 MP "
"配置选项卡中通过 Radio Calibration（而非遥控发射机）勾选副翼（转向）或油门的「reverse」复选框进行纠正。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:128
#: 6b53081cb6a74fc7be352f1cb39780b3
msgid ""
"Once the functionality of the Manual and Auto modes has been verified, use "
"the Flight Planner Tab in the MP to setup a waypoint course. Make sure to "
"set the Waypoint Radius to around 2 meters for good performance."
msgstr ""
"验证 Manual 和 Auto 模式功能正常后，在 MP 的 Flight Planner 选项卡中规划航点路线。建议将航点半径设为约 2 "
"米以获得良好性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-px4-quickstart.rst:132
#: 1140886384714f54ae5af6ea2a3d4ecb
msgid ""
"A more complete guide to using the Mission Planner with Rover is described "
"in \\ :ref:`Learning a Mission <common-learning-a-mission>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 操作 Rover 的更完整指南见 :ref:`学习任务 <common-learning-a-mission>`。"
